Third-party components in hsdefrag.exe

hsdefrag.exe also contains components that are NOT covered by the licence
above; each keeps its own terms, which must be shipped with hsdefrag.exe
(make dist does this):

- CWSDPMI starter stub (dos/cwsdstub.exe), Copyright (C) Charles W Sandmann:
  GNU GPL version 2 with the exception in dos/COPYING.CWS that allows the
  stub in DJGPP programs. See dos/COPYING.CWS, dos/COPYING and dos/README
  (where to obtain its source code).
- DJGPP runtime (crt0.o, libc.a), Copyright (C) DJ Delorie and others:
  see dos/COPYING.DJ and dos/COPYING.LIB; dos/README says where to obtain
  DJGPP.
- GCC runtime library (libgcc), linked under the GCC Runtime Library
  Exception.
